"{\"status\":\"success\",\"data\":{\"address\":{\"country\":\"Italy\",\"street\":\"via Tortona\",\"number\":\"35\",\"city\":\"Milano\",\"state\":\"Milano\",\"zip\":\"20144\"},\"registrations_closed_at\":null,\"lastPreEventReminderSentAt\":null,\"_id\":\"69394e2c7ad96d9433c9a373\",\"user\":\"681dfa7196a322a6df6a78aa\",\"name\":\"Milano Sake Challenge 2026\",\"slug\":\"msc2026\",\"description_short\":\"MSC-2026\",\"description_long\":\"Milano Sake Challenge 2025\",\"from\":\"2026-06-22T00:00:00.000Z\",\"to\":\"2026-06-23T00:00:00.000Z\",\"registration_from\":\"2025-12-14T00:00:00.000Z\",\"registration_to\":\"2026-01-20T00:00:00.000Z\",\"execution_type\":\"in presence\",\"sessions\":[{\"carry_on\":null,\"required_judges\":null,\"_id\":\"6939c972a01ad75ff2cc788d\",\"competitionId\":\"69394e2c7ad96d9433c9a373\",\"name\":\"Tasting Nihonshu\",\"description\":\"TASTING NIHONSHU\",\"product_type\":\"Sake\",\"categories\":[{\"_id\":\"6939c972a01ad75ff2cc7871\",\"name\":\"Sparkling\",\"description\":\"S\",\"product_rules\":[],\"force\":19,\"createdAt\":\"2025-12-10T19:26:42.215Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-06-22T14:55:41.927Z\",\"__v\":0,\"translations\":{\"en\":{\"name\":\"Sparkling\",\"explanation\":\"Sake with effervescence from in-bottle refermentation or carbonation. What we expect: Appearance: evaluate perlage, fineness, persistence, and bubble quality. Nose: citrus aromas? fresh fruit? yeast notes? Palate: freshness and vivacity; sweet-acid balance is important. The perlage must be integrated, not aggressive.\"},\"it\":{\"name\":\"Sparkling\",\"explanation\":\"Sake con effervescenza da rifermentazione in bottiglia o carbonazione. Cosa ci aspettiamo: Aspetto: valuta il perlage, finezza, persistenza, qualità delle bolle. Olfatto: aromi agrumati? frutta fresca? note di lievito? Palato: freschezza e vivacità; il bilanciamento dolce-acido è importante. Il perlage deve essere integrato, non aggressivo.\"},\"jp\":{\"name\":\"スパークリング\",\"explanation\":\"瓶内二次発酵または炭酸ガス注入による発泡性日本酒。審査基準：外観：きめ細かさ、持続性、泡の質を評価。香り：柑橘類、新鮮な果実、酵母のニュアンス。味わい：鮮やかさと爽快感。甘味と酸味のバランスが重要。炭酸は攻撃的ではなく、酒質に溶け込んでいること。\"},\"de\":{\"name\":\"Sparkling\",\"explanation\":\"Sake mit Kohlensäure aus Flaschengärung oder Karbonisierung. Was wir erwarten: Aussehen: Bewertung der Perlage, Feinheit, Beständigkeit und Qualität der Blasen. Geruch: Zitrusaromen? frisches Obst? Hefenoten? Gaumen: Frische und Lebendigkeit; das Süß-Säure-Gleichgewicht ist wichtig. Die Perlage muss integriert und nicht aggressiv sein.\"},\"fr\":{\"name\":\"Sparkling (Pétillant)\",\"explanation\":\"Saké effervescent issu d'une refermentation en bouteille ou carbonatation. Ce que nous attendons : Apparence : évaluer le perlage, la finesse, la persistance et la qualité des bulles. Nez : arômes d'agrumes ? fruits frais ? notes de levure ? Palais : fraîcheur et vivacité ; l'équilibre sucre-acide est primordial. Le perlage doit être intégré et non agressif.\"}},\"explanation\":\"Sake con effervescenza da rifermentazione in bottiglia o carbonazione. Cosa ci aspettiamo: Aspetto: valuta il perlage, finezza, persistenza, qualità delle bolle. Olfatto: aromi agrumati? frutta fresca? note di lievito? Palato: freschezza e vivacità; il bilan"